WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:23.970
Destiny Board Brings Death

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:42.450
Destroying Dark Necrofear activated the Field Spell Dark Sanctuary.

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:45.620
What's Bakura planning?

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:53.280
Dark Sanctuary Special Summons a ghost that possesses one of his monsters.

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:59.300
The ghost wanders your field, searching for a host.

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:06.450
But you can't see which monster it possesses.

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:09.940
Something's up, but I don't know what it is.

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:13.370
Bakura doesn't have any monsters on his field.

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:18.450
If I attack him directly with Gamma The Magnet Warrior, I win.

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:20.520
That's what I should do.

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:23.960
Gamma The Magnet Warrior attacks you directly!

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:27.490
What?

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:28.810
Spirit Burn!

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:35.690
Something emerged from Gamma The Magnet Warrior and attacked me!

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:38.500
Surprised?

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:42.740
Dark Sanctuary created a ghost.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:44.120
Ghost?

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:48.230
The ghost is an Equip Card that equips on to your monster.

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:51.750
It was on my Magnet Warrior?

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:57.140
The ghost carries out the orders you gave Gamma The Magnet Warrior.

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:00.570
But you're the one who takes damage.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:08.530
You lose life points equal to half the attack points of the possessed monster.

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:09.230
What?

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:18.110
Gamma The Magnet Warrior has 1500 attack points, so you lose 750 life points.

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:26.400
And I absorb those 750 life points to recover my health!

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:29.820
You took my life points?

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.800
It's too early to be surprised, Yugi.

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:36.760
My Occult Deck's terror is only beginning!

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:39.760
My turn!  I draw a card!

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:43.280
I activate my Continuous Trap!

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:48.540
I activate Destiny Board!

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:52.480
What's that weird-looking board?

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:56.000
In Western countries, it's used for seances.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:57.680
Seances?

00:03:58.140 --> 00:04:00.920
It's like an Oujia board, right?

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.420
It gives me the creeps.

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:08.260
Destiny Board.

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:14.770
Destiny Board is a tool to communicate with spirits.

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:19.910
The spirits move the planchette and points at letters.

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:23.680
Watch it pick the first letter this turn.

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:32.580
The letter "D" appeared on the field!

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:35.860
That's not the end of it!

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:42.830
When it's your turn, the letters "E-A-T-H" will appear one at a time.

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:45.830
D-E-A-T-H...

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:46.830
Death!

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:55.880
Yes.  When the five letters spell DEATH, you automatically lose, even if you still have life points.

00:04:57.570 --> 00:05:01.420
That means I only have four turns left.

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:06.850
He let me destroy Dark Necrofear so that he could achieve this combo.

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:09.240
Oh no!

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:10.990
Yugi will lose in four turns.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:13.280
Big brother...

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:20.250
He hid a ghost in Yugi's monster to launch sneak attacks and absorb Yugi's life points.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:24.000
And his Destiny Board has declared Yugi's death!

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:27.500
Heh.  So you did have a strategy.

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:33.510
Yugi, the countdown to destruction has begun!

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:36.340
Your life ends in four turns.

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:40.340
But my occult combo is only getting started.

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:43.890
The spell card The Dark Door!

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:48.130
You can only attack with one monster per turn.

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:53.360
And I play an even more terrifying card.

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:56.560
I set this card.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:00.340
I summon Earthbound Spirit!

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:03.850
But I only need it as a tribute.

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:09.820
I need to tribute every turn to keep Dark Sanctuary.

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:11.400
I end my turn!

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:15.740
My turn.

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:25.510
Due to The Dark Door's effect, I can only attack with one monster this turn.

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:29.940
Gamma The Magnet Warrior can't attack because it's possessed.

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:33.740
But Bakura has no monsters to defend with.

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:39.240
If Dark Magician Girl attacks him directly, Bakura will lose because he only has 900 life points.

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:42.750
But he knows that too.

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:44.840
He wants me to attack.

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:47.750
That set card must a trap.

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:49.080
What's wrong?

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:52.800
But I only have a few turns left.

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:56.000
I know it's a trap, but I still have to attack.

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:59.600
I summon Kuriboh in defense position.

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.900
Dark Magician Girl attacks!

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.550
Black Burning!

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:11.620
Spirit Burn!

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:17.770
It possessed Dark Magician Girl this time?

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:27.960
Your life points lose half of Dark Magician Girl's 2500 attack points, and I gain that amount.

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:36.200
I forgot to tell you that Dark Sanctuary's ghost can possess a different monster each turn.

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:42.710
If you don't choose your attacking monster carefully, you're going to hurt yourself.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.350
I end my turn.

00:07:45.850 --> 00:07:48.300
Destiny Board's effect activates!

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:52.350
The card Spirit Message.

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:57.850
He has two letters, D and E!

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.740
Do you now understand?

00:08:00.740 --> 00:08:06.860
Every time you end your turn, Destiny Board adds a letter.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:20.530
Bakura, you need three more Spirit Message cards to spell DEATH.

00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:25.120
But you only have one open slot in your Duel Disk!

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:28.570
Thanks for the warning.

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:32.500
But you didn't find a flaw in my plan.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:39.080
I'll show you that Dark Sanctuary does more than create ghosts.

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:44.880
It lets me place spell and trap cards in the Monster Card Zone.

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:50.640
You can play up to ten spell or trap cards?

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:54.960
My occult combo is perfect.

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:58.700
Yugi, your life ends in three turns!

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:01.660
You can't escape your destiny!

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:05.770
Yugi!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:08.020
Damn!  He has Yugi cornered!

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:11.710
Yugi has to do something about Destiny Board.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:17.270
But he doesn't know which monster is possessed by a ghost.

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:21.770
If he attacks carelessly, he'll take damage.

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:27.140
But if Yugi does nothing, he'll lose in three turns.

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:30.220
Brother, is Yugi going to lose?

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:32.460
No.  Believe in Yugi.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.570
He'll come up with something.

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:36.330
Here I go!

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:37.950
My turn!

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:43.730
If you do nothing, you'll definitely lose in three turns.

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:45.390
I summon Sangan!

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:52.730
I tribute Sangan for Dark Sanctuary.

00:09:54.680 --> 00:09:59.310
Due to Sangan's effect, I can draw a card from my deck.

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:02.260
I end my turn!

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.080
My turn!  I draw!

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:14.320
Which one should I possess?

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:17.920
I'll possess Dark Magician Girl again.

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:22.720
Yugi, you can't see it.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:26.940
Which monster did he possess this turn?

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:29.110
It's definitely not Kuriboh.

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:32.940
He knows that this monster isn't the attacking type.

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:36.460
It's either Gamma The Magnet Warrior...

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:40.710
...or Dark Magician Girl.

00:10:41.920 --> 00:10:49.930
Since he has the Continous Spell The Dark Door, only one of my monsters can attack.

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:51.930
Odds are one in two.

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:19.490
I just drew this card, so the ghost isn't possessing it.

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:22.990
But Big Shield Gardna is for defensive purposes.

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:27.650
Since it only has 100 attack points, there's no point summoning it in attack position.

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:30.230
Big Shield Gardna in defense position!

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:35.400
Yugi, you're scared!

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:37.370
You can't win if you only defend!

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:40.040
He's right.

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:43.050
I only have a few turns left.

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:46.780
I must choose one of these monsters.

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:49.790
I can't defeat Bakura if I don't fight.

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:51.020
I'll take a risk!

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:55.200
Gamma The Magnet Warrior attacks!

00:11:57.600 --> 00:11:59.620
You have great instincts.

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:02.260
But I'm always one step ahead of you.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:06.840
I activate the trap card Dark Spirit of the Silent!

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:12.460
It possesses and silences a monster in attack position.

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:16.810
Your attack orders switch to another monster.

00:12:17.280 --> 00:12:21.420
Dark Spirit, possess Gamma The Magnet Warrior!

00:12:25.020 --> 00:12:31.330
Gamma The Magnet Warrior is silenced, so my attack orders switch to Dark Magician Girl!

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:36.770
But Dark Sanctuary's ghost possesses her.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:39.550
Spirit Burn!

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:44.760
You can never break my occult combo!

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:47.560
Bakura's occult combo is perfect.

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:49.140
It can't be broken!

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:52.120
Oh no!  Yugi is going to lose?

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:52.820
Oops.

00:12:52.820 --> 00:12:54.100
Otogi!

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:57.340
You keep saying that Yugi's going to lose!

00:12:57.340 --> 00:12:59.860
Stop making Shizuka worried!

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:01.560
No, I...

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:03.220
Brother!

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:07.230
Yugi, show me that you're a true duelist.

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:09.740
This is bad, big brother.

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:12.230
Yugi is in real trouble!

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:16.880
Yugi can no longer attack during his Battle Phase.

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:22.440
Will he let the turns pass by and wait for death?

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:30.620
No.  Yugi will turn this duel around.

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:34.860
This isn't enough to break his dueling spirit.

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:37.570
Yugi, you're finished.

00:13:37.570 --> 00:13:40.570
My occult combo has no weaknesses.

00:13:42.100 --> 00:13:45.380
Think!  There must be a way!

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:50.740
The problem is the invisible ghost that possesses my monsters.

00:13:50.920 --> 00:13:55.300
In order to break his occult combo, I have to do something about that ghost.

00:13:55.820 --> 00:13:59.400
But how can I fight an invisible enemy?

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:01.200
What's wrong, Yugi?

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:03.220
You're allowed to surrender.

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:07.160
The ghost is an Equip Card that possesses a monster.

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:08.580
Equip Card...

00:14:12.060 --> 00:14:13.330
There is a way!

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:15.740
I set two cards!

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:22.720
No matter what you do, you're still going to die.

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:24.840
But you'll keep fighting in vain?

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:25.800
Yeah.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:30.840
No matter how bad the situation, I try to survive each turn!

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:33.230
Because the next turn may have potential!

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:34.750
You make me laugh!

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:36.080
There is no potential!

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:37.590
I end my turn!

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:40.440
Destiny Board's effect activates!

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:48.830
The third letter!

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:50.830
What will you do, Yugi?

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:53.330
There are only two letters left.

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:55.200
My turn!

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:00.370
I summon Souls of the Forgotten!

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:03.040
I tribute it for Dark Sanctuary!

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:08.280
You're standing on the edge of death.

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:13.760
During the final two turns, I'll watch you quake in fear.

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:15.090
I end my turn!

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:18.100
You sure like to talk.

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:21.690
But you shouldn't be so confident.

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:22.970
What?

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:28.700
Bakura, I'll break your occult combo in my final two turns!

00:15:29.020 --> 00:15:31.710
He found a way to make a comeback!

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:35.440
Yeah!  I knew Yugi would think of something!

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:41.180
Yugi, let me see how you break out of this situation.

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:43.850
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:51.270
You'll break my occult combo in two turns?

00:15:52.670 --> 00:15:55.100
Enough with your nonsense.

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:58.270
You're the one who's overconfident!

00:15:58.510 --> 00:16:01.270
Each card has potential.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.700
So for every card in my hand, I have more potential!

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:06.240
And here's one!

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:08.950
The trap card Collected Power!

00:16:09.970 --> 00:16:14.170
All Equip Cards are equipped on to Kuriboh!

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:27.200
Collected Power equips all Equip Cards on to the selected monster.

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:32.670
So Dark Magician Girl's Magic Formula equips on to Kuriboh.

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:35.070
That's not all!

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:40.700
You said that the ghost was an Equip Card that equips on to my monster.

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:50.050
I can't see the ghost, but Collected Power moved the ghost on to Kuriboh.

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:55.890
I didn't think of that!

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:59.540
The spell card Exile of the Wicked.

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:03.730
Exile of the Wicked destroys all Fiend-Type monsters on the field.

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:09.240
The possessed Kuriboh is a Fiend-Type.

00:17:13.820 --> 00:17:17.880
Dark Sanctuary's ghost vanishes with Kuriboh!

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:22.170
Don't get overconfident, Yugi!

00:17:22.170 --> 00:17:26.110
You haven't broken my occult combo yet!

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:27.680
Patience, Bakura.

00:17:27.680 --> 00:17:29.890
My turn isn't over yet.

00:17:30.910 --> 00:17:34.130
He has another set card!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.710
Go, Yugi!

00:17:35.710 --> 00:17:37.130
Yugi, do your best!

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:45.140
It seems Yugi found your occult combo's weak point.

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:46.750
Weak point?

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:51.380
I know what his set card is.

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:54.380
Quit talking or I'll kill you!

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:55.880
Just listen.

00:17:56.510 --> 00:18:01.640
Your occult combo is nasty, but it has its limits.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:09.400
Dark Sanctuary covered up its weak points, but Dark Sanctuary's activation requirements are the problem.

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:10.800
What?

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:17.200
You must have Dark Necrofear in the graveyard to activate Dark Sanctuary.

00:18:17.600 --> 00:18:25.170
If Dark Necrofear returns to the field, Dark Sanctuary's effect will vanish.

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:31.650
That should be enough info to figure out what the set card is.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:34.650
Monster Reborn.

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:37.140
Yes.  Monster Reborn!

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:43.900
Bakura, this will destroy your occult combo!

00:18:44.130 --> 00:18:46.930
The spell card Monster Reborn!

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:53.270
I resurrect Dark Necrofear!

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:08.790
Since Dark Necrofear has resurrected, Dark Sanctuary's effect is gone.

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:09.790
Damn!

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:17.530
You can now only place five spell or trap cards on your Duel Disk.

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:21.030
I only have one open slot.

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:24.040
I attack you directly!

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:27.280
Dark Necrofear!  Killer Eye!

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:34.050
I end my turn.

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:40.270
Destiny Board's effect activates!

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:51.200
D-E-A-T.  You have four letters.

00:19:51.820 --> 00:19:55.570
But you'll never get the last letter!

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:59.300
There's no space to set the last letter!

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:05.250
To make room for all five letters, you must get rid of The Dark Door.

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:09.480
But if you get rid of it, all my monsters will attack you!

00:20:10.170 --> 00:20:13.150
I'll destroy your occult combo in one more turn!

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:16.560
I don't have a monster on my field.

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:21.850
If all his monsters attack me, I'll lose.

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:24.800
Unbelievable!

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:27.450
I think it's over.

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:28.300
Of course!

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:30.400
Big brother?

00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:34.310
Ryo Bakura, you fought well against Yugi.

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:39.340
That was quick.

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:40.730
Be quiet!

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:44.350
Maybe there's still something you can do.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:45.720
Silence!

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:49.350
I don't need your advice!  Go away!

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:52.860
There's no way I'll lose!

00:20:52.860 --> 00:20:55.360
This draw will turn the tables!

00:20:55.840 --> 00:20:57.130
I draw a card!

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:02.160
You're done, Yugi!

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:06.370
With this card, you can't break my occult combo!

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:07.390
What?

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:10.880
Say what?  He still can do something?

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:13.880
He doesn't know when to give up!

00:21:13.880 --> 00:21:15.360
Maybe he's bluffing.

